  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(14 fotos) El Local de Asociaciones de La Safona ha acogido la tarde-noche de este jueves el sorteo de los quince premios de la campa&ntilde;a del amor y la amistad, por San Valent&iacute;n, de Onda Centre Comercial (OCC): cinco viajes para dos personas de fin de semana a hoteles de 4 estrellascon spa y diez cenas rom&aacute;nticas, tambi&eacute;n para dos personas.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/IMG_4476.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Los premios se entregar&aacute;n este lunes, 19 de febrero, a las 20.30 horas en el sal&oacute;n de actos de la Casa de Cultura. Han dirigido el sorteo la presidenta de OCC, Ana Mart&iacute; Olucha, y el secretario adjunto, Ram&oacute;n Jord&aacute;n Cameselle. Ha extraido las diez papeletas, m&aacute;s cuatro de reserva, Anna Villa Mart&iacute;.</span></p>\n<p><strong>ESTANCIAS EN HOTEL DE 4 ESTRELLAS EN L&#39;ALBIR</strong></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:651px;\" width=\"976\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:329px;\">\n    <p align=\"center\">PERSONAS PREMIADAS</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:321px;\">\n    <p align=\"center\">ENTREGADO EN</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:329px;\">\n    <p>JUANMA L&Oacute;PEZ GALLARDO</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:321px;\">\n    <p>MIL ESTILS</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:329px;\">\n    <p>M&ordf; VICTORIA GADEA L&Oacute;PEZ</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:321px;\">\n    <p>MODA INFANTIL BABAIA</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"><strong>ESTANCIAS EN HOTEL DE 4 ESTRELLAS EN ALBORAIA</strong></div>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:651px;\" width=\"976\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:329px;\">\n    <p>AMPARO LECHA PUERTO</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:321px;\">\n    <p>CLINICA DENTAL EUGENIA VI&Ntilde;ALS</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:329px;\">\n    <p>TERESA GARCIA BOU</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:321px;\">\n    <p>CLINICA DENTAL EUGENIA VI&Ntilde;ALS</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:329px;\">\n    <p>DORA PALASI VICENT</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:321px;\">\n    <p>TOP QUEENS</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>CENAS ROM&Aacute;NTICAS PARA DOS PERSONAS EN RESTAURANTE PALMITO</strong></p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p align=\"center\">PREMIADOS</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p align=\"center\">ENTREGADO EN</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p>SONIA ANTON AGUILELLA</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p>EL VESTIDOR DE VIANA</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p>CARLOS LAHUERTA CHIVA</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p>ELECTRODOMESTICOS MILLA</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p>ESTHER MART&Iacute;NEZ L&Oacute;PEZ</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p>HIPERCALZADO ONDA</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p>LORENZO L&Oacute;PEZ RODR&Iacute;GUEZ</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p>HIPERCALZADO ONDA</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p>TRINIDAD PITARCH DIAGO</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p>JOIES AURUM</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p>APARICIO MU&Ntilde;OZ MEDINA</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p>L&rsquo;ESTACIO</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p>MAR MENEU VARELLA</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p>MODA INFANTIL BABAIA</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p>BEA CAN&Oacute;S GOMEZ</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p>TAMAYOIMATGE</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p>GLORIA PEIDR&Oacute; PERIS</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p>TAMAYOIMATGE</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"width:305px;\">\n    <p>MANUELA SANCHEZ JUAREZ</p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"width:313px;\">\n    <p>TOP QUEENS</p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentiocc18/img_4475.jpg\" alt=\"img_4475\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentiocc18/img_4476.jpg\" alt=\"img_4476\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentiocc18/img_4480.jpg\" alt=\"img_4480\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentiocc18/img_4481.jpg\" alt=\"img_4481\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentiocc18/img_4482.jpg\" alt=\"img_4482\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentiocc18/img_4483.jpg\" alt=\"img_4483\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentiocc18/img_4484.jpg\" alt=\"img_4484\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigsantvalentiocc18/img_4486.jpg\" alt=\"img_4486\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https:/